    {
      "type": "updated",
      "source": "wgmods",
      "sourceId": "7872",
      "title": "Evolved: Girls and Panzer Voice Selector (all voices)",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "2.2.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.0",
        "fileName": "Ver_2.2.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-12T11:45:59.745Z",
        "changeLog": "Improvements\n1. The original Japanese voice lines were transcribed by ear. Based on these transcriptions, the Chinese and English subtitles were reviewed and corrected for accuracy. A Japanese subtitle version was also created.\n2. Added subtitle versions in Russian, German, French, Spanish, Polish, and Italian."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "2.3.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.1",
        "fileName": "Ver_2.3.0.1.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-22T12:35:48.406Z",
        "changeLog": "Improvements\n1. Added the “GuP Voice Selector: Ignore the voices of special crews” option to the Mods menu in the Garage. It works in the same way as the corresponding option at the bottom of Settings → Sound. This provides an alternative way to access the setting in case the option in the game client settings does not appear due to conflicts with other mods.\n2. Based on advice from experienced players, the way voice options are integrated into the mod has been improved. Newly added Commanders with their own unique voiceovers can now use their original unique voiceovers normally without having to wait for an update to this mod.\n3. Fixed several issues in the Polish subtitle version based on player feedback.\n4. Updated the additional voice lines for Alice (by official) so that they better match the story and character context of Girls und Panzer."
      }
    },
